    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a disastrous expedition, Serpico washes ashore on an uncharted island. Alone and armed with only his blade and pendant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Serpico</i> is deliberate and deadly. Every swing, dodge, and parry matters. Time your strikes carefully against aggressive enemies that punish recklessness. Wield a variety of melee weapons and combine them with divine magic to control the flow of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Divine  Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness magic gifted by Seraphel, the god of light. Divine  magic adds an optional layer to combat \u2014 and can turn the tide of even the most hopeless encounter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Ancient Ruin and Acquire Hidden Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of a land torn apart. Powerful knowledge lie in the depths of the Island.  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a disastrous expedition, Serpico washes ashore on an uncharted island. Alone and armed with only his blade and pendant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Serpico</i> is deliberate and deadly. Every swing, dodge, and parry matters. Time your strikes carefully against aggressive enemies that punish recklessness. Wield a variety of melee weapons and combine them with divine magic to control the flow of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Divine  Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness magic gifted by Seraphel, the god of light. Divine  magic adds an optional layer to combat \u2014 and can turn the tide of even the most hopeless encounter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Ancient Ruin and Acquire Hidden Relics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remains of a land torn apart. Powerful knowledge lie in the depths of the Island.  </p>",
